[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13740.63, "timestamp": "03:49:00", "text": "両手で操作できるかどうか確認しましたか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13744.87, "timestamp": "03:49:04", "text": "武器は消えるだろう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13747.03, "timestamp": "03:49:07", "text": "何か手元にあるものはありますか？どのような"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13749.03, "timestamp": "03:49:09", "text": "私にも起こったの？私のダイヤモンドのつるはしと私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13751.99, "timestamp": "03:49:11", "text": "昨日、あの時怒ってゲームをやめてしまった。のように、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13754.51, "timestamp": "03:49:14", "text": "それを確認しましたか？それはまだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13758.15, "timestamp": "03:49:18", "text": "問題か？私のコンステラーナ。したい"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13759.79, "timestamp": "03:49:19", "text": "私の刀を使って、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13762.63, "timestamp": "03:49:22", "text": "兄弟。でも、そうなったらどうなるかはわかりません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13765.83, "timestamp": "03:49:25", "text": "もうどうすればいいのか。私は使えません"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 13768.723, "timestamp": "03:49:28", "author": "@astravt", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MdOwC7qdh0gmlabcCYgLQ5BOZxo7CGLbc14xFv1rO9eQ745gkga99YKsszwMjcyNnEBittX8WA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "join game and we will talk there"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13769.67, "timestamp": "03:49:29", "text": "大剣か、それとも今は刀か。ああ、でも"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13771.75, "timestamp": "03:49:31", "text": "それについて調べてみてください。それが唯一の"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 13771.778, "timestamp": "03:49:31", "author": "@astravt", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MdOwC7qdh0gmlabcCYgLQ5BOZxo7CGLbc14xFv1rO9eQ745gkga99YKsszwMjcyNnEBittX8WA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "u can sing"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 13773.734, "timestamp": "03:49:33", "author": "@astravt", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MdOwC7qdh0gmlabcCYgLQ5BOZxo7CGLbc14xFv1rO9eQ745gkga99YKsszwMjcyNnEBittX8WA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "now"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13775.95, "timestamp": "03:49:35", "text": "私が欲しいものを問題に出します。えっと、何？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13778.55, "timestamp": "03:49:38", "text": "それ以外？どうなるか見てみよう。わかった。わかった。私は私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13780.95, "timestamp": "03:49:40", "text": "そうしてください。あなたは歌える。こんにちは、最後まで話させてください"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13786.389, "timestamp": "03:49:46", "text": "これ。わかった。えっと、偽物を手に入れたんだけど"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 13788.524, "timestamp": "03:49:48", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hm5IY4W-H9SO5QS6n4CwCA"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13790.83, "timestamp": "03:49:50", "text": "1つ。わかった。 ３、２、１。"}]